--- !u!102 &103627068
TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 103627066}
  m_Text: 'FACILITIES  -  FLOOR 4

    Re: room numbering


    Rooms on this floor will

    be renumbered again from

    Monday. Where two doors

    carry the same number,

    report it to Facilities.

    Do not wedge either door.


    The corridor by Reception

    has been measured twice.

    Both figures are on file.


    W. Brisk, Facilities'
  m_OffsetZ: 0
  m_CharacterSize: 0.00954861
  m_LineSpacing: 1
